@startuml
!theme plain
class UserController
class UserService
interface UserRepository
class UserMapper
class User
class UserResponse
class ProfilePictureResponse
class ChangeUsernameRequest
class PasswordEncoder
interface ProfilePictureUseCase
interface ObjectStoragePort

UserController --> UserService
UserService --> UserRepository
UserService --> UserMapper
UserService --> PasswordEncoder
UserService --> ProfilePictureUseCase
ProfilePictureUseCase --> ObjectStoragePort
UserRepository --> User
UserMapper --> UserResponse
UserController ..> ProfilePictureResponse
UserController ..> ChangeUsernameRequest

note right of UserService
  Identity comes from the
  authenticated principal.
  Passwords are encoded.
end note

note bottom of UserController
  Password changes are not
  part of this module:
  PATCH /api/v1/auth/password
end note
@enduml
